The '''assassination of Mirmo ish Zhifol''' was one of the key events that led to the end of the [[Qymish succession crisis of 2440–2441]]. [[Mirmo ish Zhifol]], eldest son of [[Bacha XVIII of Qym|King Bacha XVIII]] and older brother of [[Bacha XIX of Qym|King Bacha XIX]], was assassinated on DAY MONTH {{abbr|2441|2027.8 (Earth Year Equivalent)}} by [[TBD]]. 

